Python's asyncio can allow the MCP application to handle I/O operations without blocking the event loop while those operations are waiting.

=========

| Term          | Meaning                                                                     |
| ------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Async**     | A programming approach where waiting doesn't have to block other async work |
| **`async`**   | Python keyword used to define an async function                             |
| **`await`**   | Wait for an async result while yielding control                             |
| **`asyncio`** | Python library/framework for managing asynchronous operations               |
| **MCP**       | Protocol that can use async programming for tool/data communication         |


